        <li><a href="http://www.loc.gov/exhibits/books-that-shaped-america/1950-to-2000.html#obj19">James D. Watson (b. 1928). <em>The Double Helix: A Personal Account of the Discovery of the Structure of DNA.</em> London: Weidenfeld &amp; Nicolson, 1968</a>. General Collections, Library of Congress (094.00.00)</li>
