        <li><a href="http://www.loc.gov/exhibits/books-that-shaped-america/1950-to-2000.html#obj21">Boston Women’s Health Book Collective. <em>Our Bodies, Ourselves: A Book By and For Women.</em> New York: Simon &amp; Schuster, 1973.</a> General Collections, Library of Congress (096.00.00) </li>
