        <li><a href="http://www.loc.gov/exhibits/books-that-shaped-america/1950-to-2000.html#obj23">Toni Morrison (b. 1931). <em>Beloved: A Novel.</em> New York: Knopf, 1987.</a> Rare Book and Special Collections Division, Library of Congress (098.00.00)</li>
        <li><a href="http://www.loc.gov/exhibits/books-that-shaped-america/1950-to-2000.html#obj24">Randy Shilts (1951&ndash;1994). <em>And the Band Played On: Politics, People, and the AIDS Epidemic.</em> New York: St. Martin’s Press, 1987.</a> Rare Book and Special Collections Division, Library of Congress (099.00.00)</li>
